# For development
#
# The last two are a net rather than a list. A one-off script left at the root
# is invisible in a repository and ships to every consumer of the package, which
# is how an 8 kB throwaway `.fix.py` went out in a release; naming the shapes
# catches the next one without anybody having to remember to.
*.py
.*.py
scripts/
.git*
.eslintignore
eslint.config.ts
.prettierignore
.prettierrc
.editorconfig
terser.config.json
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.prod.json
vitest.config.ts
postcss.config.mjs
pnpm-workspace.yaml
